            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-112060-librtmp1",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-112060 medium vulnerability for librtmp1 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "librtmp in RTMPDump through 2.6 contains an out-of-bounds read and heap out-of-bounds write vulnerability because AMF3_Decode ignores AMF3 property decode failures. Malicious RTMP servers or man-in-the-middle attackers can send oversized AMF3 string lengths, and with the token option DecodeTEA corrupts heap memory and leaks heap bytes."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-112060",
