                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/python3.12-venv@3.12.3-1ubuntu0.17?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-24.04\u0026upstream=python3.12"
                ],
                "security-severity": "6.4"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-124249-libpython3.12-minimal",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-124249 medium vulnerability for libpython3.12-minimal package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "http.cookiejar.CookieJar deleted a stored cookie when a response carried an\nalready expired Set-Cookie header for it, using the Domain and Path\nattributes from the header without consulting the cookie policy. A server\ncould therefore delete cookies belonging to other domains from a shared\ncookie jar, such as the one used by urllib's HTTPCookieProcessor. The fix\nconsults the cookie policy before an expired cookie may delete an existing\none, as required by RFC 6265 section 5.3."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-124249",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-124249\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libpython3.12-minimal\nVersion: 3.12.3-1ubuntu0.17\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/info/libpython3.12-minimal:amd64.conffiles\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-124249](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-124249)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-124249**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libpython3.12-minimal  | 3.12.3-1ubuntu0.17  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/info/libpython3.12-minimal:amd64.conffiles  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-124249](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-124249)  |\n"
              },
