              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-35190\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: openssl\nVersion: 3.0.13-0ubuntu3.16\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/info/openssl.conffiles\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-35190](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-35190)",
